{
  "duration": 79.219,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.259,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.68,
      "end": 1.36,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.839,
      "end": 2.899,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.279,
      "end": 6.639,
      "text": "Now, in this problem, we are given that the speed of the boat in still water"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.139,
      "end": 8.76,
      "text": "is 18 kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.3,
      "end": 11.659,
      "text": "The speed of the stream is three kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.159,
      "end": 13.539,
      "text": "The boat has to travel"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.88,
      "end": 15.38,
      "text": "84 kilometers downstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.799,
      "end": 18.799,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the time taken for this journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.159,
      "end": 20.68,
      "text": "Now, before solving the problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.159,
      "end": 22.379,
      "text": "let us understand this."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.739,
      "end": 26.899,
      "text": "When a boat moves downstream, it moves in the same direction as the flowing water."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.319,
      "end": 30.099,
      "text": "Because both the boat and the stream are moving in the same direction,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.5,
      "end": 32.539,
      "text": "the stream helps the boat move faster."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.939,
      "end": 34.279,
      "text": "So for downstream movement,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.619,
      "end": 35.479,
      "text": "we always"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.899,
      "end": 38.799,
      "text": "add the speed of the stream to the speed of the boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.239,
      "end": 40.719,
      "text": "Be very sure about this rule."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.279,
      "end": 44.619,
      "text": "Downstream speed is equal to speed of boat in still water plus"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.979,
      "end": 45.719,
      "text": "speed of stream."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.119,
      "end": 47.779,
      "text": "Now let us find the downstream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.259,
      "end": 52.779,
      "text": "Downstream speed is equal to 18 plus three. This gives us"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.119,
      "end": 54.619,
      "text": "21 kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.079,
      "end": 56.359,
      "text": "Now this part is completed."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.86,
      "end": 58.919,
      "text": "Since we know the distance and the speed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.539,
      "end": 61.839,
      "text": "we can find the time. We know the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.379,
      "end": 64.979,
      "text": "Time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.459,
      "end": 66.419,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.9,
      "end": 69.459,
      "text": "time is equal to 84 divided by 21."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.9,
      "end": 71.72,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.059,
      "end": 76.019,
      "text": "So the boat will take four hours to travel 84 kilometers downstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.339,
      "end": 76.699,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.099,
      "end": 79.219,
      "text": "the correct answer is option D."
    }
  ],
